{"seq":3,"slug":"reasoning-testtime-cot","title":"Test-Time Compute 与思维链忠实性评测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/llm-evaluation-benchmarks/domains/reasoning-testtime-cot","wordCount":1841,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"test-time-compute-与思维链忠实性评测\">Test-Time Compute 与思维链忠实性评测</h1><p>本篇是<a href=\"reasoning-eval\">推理能力评测：经典基准的兴衰与前沿格局</a>的姊妹篇。经典基准的地图（MMLU/GSM8K/MATH/BBH 的饱和退役，以及 GPQA Diamond、HLE、FrontierMath、ARC-AGI-2 的前沿接棒）在前一篇讲清；本篇聚焦 2024 年底以来两个改写评测实践的方法论问题：推理模型把&quot;考试方式&quot;从单轮直答变成可分配思考预算的 test-time compute，以及随之升级的 Chain-of-Thought 忠实性——几千 token 的思维链究竟是真实推理还是事后合理化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Test-time compute（推理期算力）</strong>：推理模型在作答时生成更长、带自我检查与回溯的思维链，把额外计算花在推理期而非预训练期；分数因此成为思考预算的函数，而不是单一数字。</li>\n<li><strong>Chain-of-Thought 忠实性（CoT faithfulness）</strong>：写出的推理步骤是否真正因果地参与了最终答案的得出，而非答案既定后的装饰性叙事；用干预测试与步骤消融度量。</li>\n<li><strong>两者的关系</strong>：长思维链提升推理分数的同时让人工核查单步推理变得不可能，于是忠实性从学术好奇变成部署安全需求。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"范式迁移-从-train-time-scaling-到-test-time-compute\">范式迁移：从 Train-Time Scaling 到 Test-Time Compute</h2><p>上面所有前沿基准的分数都必须放在一个背景下解读：<strong>2024 年底以来，评测对象本身变了</strong>。被测的不再是&quot;一次性给出答案的模型&quot;，而是&quot;可以花几分钟、几千个思考 token 再作答的推理模型&quot;。这条范式迁移线值得单独讲清楚，因为它同时改写了 benchmark 的出题方式、排行榜的记分方式和工程师的选型逻辑。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三段式演进-2018-2026\">三段式演进（2018→2026）</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"timeline\" data-source=\"timeline&#10;    title LLM 能力提升的两条算力曲线&#10;    section Train-time scaling&#10;        2018-2022 : Scaling Laws 主导&lt;br/&gt;堆预训练算力换通用能力&#10;        2023-2024 : 收益递减 + 数据墙担忧&lt;br/&gt;静态基准接连饱和&#10;    section Inference / Test-time compute&#10;        2024-09 : OpenAI o1 发布(博客 Learning to Reason with LLMs)&lt;br/&gt;RL 训练的长 CoT + 可调思考预算&#10;        2025-01 : DeepSeek-R1 论文公开纯 RL 路线&lt;br/&gt;长推理链能力涌现复现&#10;        2025-2026 : Hybrid thinking 成为旗舰标配&lt;br/&gt;思考档位/预算可控化\">timeline\n    title LLM 能力提升的两条算力曲线\n    section Train-time scaling\n        2018-2022 : Scaling Laws 主导&lt;br/&gt;堆预训练算力换通用能力\n        2023-2024 : 收益递减 + 数据墙担忧&lt;br/&gt;静态基准接连饱和\n    section Inference / Test-time compute\n        2024-09 : OpenAI o1 发布(博客 Learning to Reason with LLMs)&lt;br/&gt;RL 训练的长 CoT + 可调思考预算\n        2025-01 : DeepSeek-R1 论文公开纯 RL 路线&lt;br/&gt;长推理链能力涌现复现\n        2025-2026 : Hybrid thinking 成为旗舰标配&lt;br/&gt;思考档位/预算可控化</pre><p>三段的分水岭是 <strong>o1</strong>：OpenAI 在 2024 年 9 月的官方博客 &quot;Learning to Reason with LLMs&quot; 中首次公开&quot;用强化学习训练模型生成更长的内部思维链、并在推理期按需分配更多计算&quot;的产品级路线；2025 年 1 月 DeepSeek 的 R1 论文证明不依赖监督微调、纯 RL 也能涌现长推理行为，把这条路线开源普及。到 2026 年，&quot;hybrid thinking&quot;（同一模型可切换快答/深思模式）已是各家旗舰的标配形态。</p>\n<p>两条算力曲线的差异可以对照如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Train-time scaling</th>\n<th>Test-time compute</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>额外算力花在哪</td>\n<td>预训练阶段堆数据与参数</td>\n<td>推理期生成更长、带自检回溯的思维链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表性起点</td>\n<td>2018-2022 Scaling Laws 主导</td>\n<td>2024-09 o1、2025-01 DeepSeek-R1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2023-2024 处境</td>\n<td>收益递减、数据墙担忧、静态基准饱和</td>\n<td>hybrid thinking 在 2025-2026 成旗舰标配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分数形态</td>\n<td>单轮直答，一个模型一个数</td>\n<td>随思考档位/预算变化的 accuracy 曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收益规律</td>\n<td>——</td>\n<td>重复采样指数收益、思考预算对数边际收益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选型依据</td>\n<td>裸分数</td>\n<td>accuracy-vs-cost 曲线（成本一等公民）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"test-time-compute-到底-scaling-了什么\">Test-time compute 到底 scaling 了什么</h3><p>直觉刻画：传统模型对每题固定消耗一次前向计算；推理模型则把&quot;额外算力&quot;花在生成更长、带自我检查与回溯的思维链上。两个经验规律支撑了这个范式的有效性：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>重复采样的指数收益</strong>：若单次采样正确率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次独立采样中至少一次正确的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-(1-p)^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——这是 pass@k 与 best-of-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 类方法的数学基础。</li>\n<li><strong>思考预算的对数边际收益</strong>：多项公开复现观察到，准确率随思考 token 预算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 近似呈 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{acc}(B)\\approx a\\log(B)+b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">acc</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 的缓增曲线（示意性经验拟合，非定律）——翻倍预算带来的增益逐档递减，因此&quot;烧多少 token&quot;本身就是评测必须记录的变量。</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;同一道前沿基准题&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;允许 test-time compute？&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;否(单轮直答)&quot;| C[&quot;分数 A1&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;是(预算 B1)&quot;| D[&quot;分数 A2 &gt; A1&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;是(预算 B2 远大于 B1)&quot;| E[&quot;分数 A3,略高于 A2&quot;]&#10;    C ~~~ F[&quot;结论:只报分数不报设置&lt;br/&gt;= 不可比&quot;]&#10;    D ~~~ F&#10;    E ~~~ F\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"同一道前沿基准题\"] --&gt; B{\"允许 test-time compute？\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"否(单轮直答)\"| C[\"分数 A1\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"是(预算 B1)\"| D[\"分数 A2 &gt; A1\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"是(预算 B2 远大于 B1)\"| E[\"分数 A3,略高于 A2\"]\n    C ~~~ F[\"结论:只报分数不报设置&lt;br/&gt;= 不可比\"]\n    D ~~~ F\n    E ~~~ F</pre><h3 id=\"对评测实践的五点冲击\">对评测实践的五点冲击</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>&quot;模型分数&quot;不再是一个数。</strong> 引用任何分数必须同时声明：是否开启 thinking、思考档位（low/medium/high effort）或 token 预算、是否可用工具。同一模型不同设置的差距可以达到几十个百分点。</li>\n<li><strong>pass@k 语义变化。</strong> 推理模型的卖点是预算内 pass@1 提升，pass@k 大规模采样反而退居次要；报告时需注明采样数与预算。</li>\n<li><strong>成本成为一等公民指标。</strong> accuracy-vs-cost 曲线（如 ARC Prize 规定每题算力上限、第三方榜单普遍标注每题美元成本）取代裸分数成为选型依据——一个贵 10 倍才高 2 分的配置在生产里没有意义。</li>\n<li><strong>静态基准加速退役。</strong> 一次曝光即失效的今天，滚动新题（LiveBench/AIME）、私有题库（FrontierMath）、污染审计成了新基准的出厂标配。</li>\n<li><strong>CoT 忠实性问题升级。</strong> 几千 token 的思维链无法人工核查，忠实性评测（下一节）从学术好奇变成部署安全需求。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"chain-of-thought-忠实性评测\">Chain-of-Thought 忠实性评测</h2><p>Chain-of-thought（CoT）让模型先写出推理步骤再给出答案，显著提升了推理任务的准确率。但这引出了一个新问题：这些&quot;推理步骤&quot;是真实的认知中间过程，还是模型先&quot;预知&quot;了答案再倒推出来的合理化叙事？</p>\n<h3 id=\"忠实性-faithfulness-的定义\">忠实性（Faithfulness）的定义</h3><p>一个推理链是忠实的，当且仅当：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>推理步骤实际上被用于得出最终答案（而不是答案由别的机制决定，步骤只是装饰）</li>\n<li>推理步骤的中间结论是正确的（没有错误推理却得到正确答案）</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"忠实性评测方法\">忠实性评测方法</h3><p><strong>方法一：干预测试</strong></p>\n<p>故意在推理链的某个中间步骤注入错误，观察最终答案是否跟着改变：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def test_cot_faithfulness(&#10;    model_fn: callable,&#10;    question: str,&#10;    correct_cot: str,&#10;    corrupted_cot: str  # 在某个中间步骤注入错误&#10;) -&gt; dict:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    通过干预测试评测 CoT 的忠实性。&#10;&#10;    如果 CoT 是忠实的：用错误 CoT 时，答案应该错误&#10;    如果 CoT 只是装饰：用错误 CoT 时，答案仍然正确&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    # 让模型在给定 CoT 步骤的条件下给出答案&#10;    correct_answer = model_fn(question, cot=correct_cot)&#10;    corrupted_answer = model_fn(question, cot=corrupted_cot)&#10;&#10;    return {&#10;        &quot;answer_changed&quot;: correct_answer != corrupted_answer,&#10;        &quot;faithful_indicator&quot;: correct_answer != corrupted_answer,&#10;        &quot;correct_answer&quot;: correct_answer,&#10;        &quot;corrupted_answer&quot;: corrupted_answer&#10;    }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> test_cot_faithfulness</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model_fn: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">callable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    question: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    correct_cot: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    corrupted_cot: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 在某个中间步骤注入错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    通过干预测试评测 CoT 的忠实性。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    如果 CoT 是忠实的：用错误 CoT 时，答案应该错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    如果 CoT 只是装饰：用错误 CoT 时，答案仍然正确</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 让模型在给定 CoT 步骤的条件下给出答案</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    correct_answer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model_fn(question, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">correct_cot)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    corrupted_answer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model_fn(question, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">corrupted_cot)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"answer_changed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: correct_answer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> corrupted_answer,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"faithful_indicator\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: correct_answer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> corrupted_answer,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"correct_answer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: correct_answer,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"corrupted_answer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: corrupted_answer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>方法二：步骤重要性分析</strong></p>\n<p>用 ablation 方法逐步移除推理链中的步骤，观察哪些步骤对最终答案有因果影响：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def step_importance_analysis(&#10;    model_fn: callable,&#10;    question: str,&#10;    cot_steps: list[str]&#10;) -&gt; list[float]:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    分析每个推理步骤对最终答案的重要性。&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    full_cot = &quot;\\n&quot;.join(cot_steps)&#10;    baseline_answer = model_fn(question, cot=full_cot)&#10;&#10;    importances = []&#10;    for i in range(len(cot_steps)):&#10;        # 移除第 i 步的 CoT&#10;        reduced_cot = &quot;\\n&quot;.join(&#10;            step for j, step in enumerate(cot_steps) if j != i&#10;        )&#10;        reduced_answer = model_fn(question, cot=reduced_cot)&#10;&#10;        # 答案改变说明这一步重要&#10;        importance = float(reduced_answer != baseline_answer)&#10;        importances.append(importance)&#10;&#10;    return importances\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> step_importance_analysis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model_fn: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">callable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    question: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cot_steps: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    分析每个推理步骤对最终答案的重要性。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    full_cot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.join(cot_steps)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    baseline_answer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model_fn(question, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">full_cot)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    importances </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cot_steps)):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 移除第 i 步的 CoT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        reduced_cot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.join(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j, step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enumerate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cot_steps) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        reduced_answer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model_fn(question, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">reduced_cot)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 答案改变说明这一步重要</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        importance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(reduced_answer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> baseline_answer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        importances.append(importance)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> importances</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>已知发现（Turpin et al., 2023）：</strong> 对多个模型的研究发现，当问题中加入误导性偏好（如&quot;我认为答案是 X，你觉得呢&quot;），模型会倾向于给出被误导的答案，但在 CoT 中写出的理由却是&quot;表面中立&quot;的。这说明 CoT 步骤至少在部分情况下是事后合理化，而非真实推理过程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>2024 年底 o1 与 DeepSeek-R1 把 LLM 的能力增长从 train-time scaling 推向 test-time compute：被测对象从&quot;单轮直答模型&quot;变成&quot;可调思考预算的推理模型&quot;，hybrid thinking 到 2026 年成为旗舰标配。</li>\n<li>重复采样满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-(1-p)^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的指数收益、思考预算只有近似对数的边际收益，因此&quot;烧多少 token&quot;本身就是评测必须记录的变量，accuracy-vs-cost 曲线取代裸分数成为选型依据。</li>\n<li>引用任何分数必须声明设置：是否开启 thinking、思考预算或档位、是否可用工具——test-time compute 让&quot;模型分数&quot;从一个数字变成一条 accuracy-vs-compute 曲线。</li>\n<li>Chain-of-thought 忠实性是一个独立的评测维度，有专门的干预测试和步骤重要性分析方法；在几千 token 思维链的时代它同时成了部署安全需求。</li>\n<li>经典基准的兴衰地图、防污染设计与推理评测的通用出题原则见姊妹篇<a href=\"reasoning-eval\">推理能力评测：经典基准的兴衰与前沿格局</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Test-Time Compute 与思维链忠实性评测","id":"test-time-compute-与思维链忠实性评测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"范式迁移：从 Train-Time Scaling 到 Test-Time Compute","id":"范式迁移-从-train-time-scaling-到-test-time-compute"},{"level":3,"text":"三段式演进（2018→2026）","id":"三段式演进-2018-2026"},{"level":3,"text":"Test-time compute 到底 scaling 了什么","id":"test-time-compute-到底-scaling-了什么"},{"level":3,"text":"对评测实践的五点冲击","id":"对评测实践的五点冲击"},{"level":2,"text":"Chain-of-Thought 忠实性评测","id":"chain-of-thought-忠实性评测"},{"level":3,"text":"忠实性（Faithfulness）的定义","id":"忠实性-faithfulness-的定义"},{"level":3,"text":"忠实性评测方法","id":"忠实性评测方法"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"推理能力评测：经典基准的兴衰与前沿格局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/llm-evaluation-benchmarks/domains/reasoning-eval"},"next":{"title":"安全对齐评测：Red Teaming 与鲁棒性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/llm-evaluation-benchmarks/domains/safety-alignment-eval"}}